sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant URL as URL Service
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Client, DB: Shorten URL Flow
    Client->>LB: POST /api/v1/urls
    LB->>API: Forward request
    API->>URL: Generate short code
    URL->>DB: Store mapping
    DB-->>URL: Success
    URL-->>API: Return short URL
    API-->>Client: 201 Created

    Note over Client, DB: Redirect Flow
    Client->>LB: GET /abc123
    LB->>API: Forward request
    API->>Cache: Check cache
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>API: Return long URL
    else Cache miss
        API->>DB: Query mapping
        DB-->>API: Return long URL
        API->>Cache: Cache result
    end
    API-->>Client: 301 Redirect
